        {
          "text": "Musule lyayaaya, ndakalanga, ndakabona mulyango wakajwidwe kujulu, lino ijwi lyakusaanguna ndindakamvwa lyakali mbuli mweembo uundaa­ mbawida, lyakati, Boola, utante okuno, nkakutondezye zintu zyeelede kuba kuciindi ciciza. ",
