                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi cuuno cabwami cakalizyungulukidwe zyuuno zili makumi obile azine, nkabela azyuuno ezi ndakabona bapati bali makumi obile abane balikede, balisamide masani aatuba, alimwi amitwe yabo bakalijisi misini yangalida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.4",
