        {
          "text": "Alimwi kunembo lyacuuno cabwami kwakali lwizi lwaciboniboni, lwakali kubalangala mbuli krustalo, nkabela mukati kacuuno akuzyunguluka ncico kwakali banyama bone bali ameso manji akunkosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
