        },
        {
          "text": "Munyama mutaanzi wakalikozyenye amulavu, munyama wabili wakalikozyene amoombe, munyama watatu wakali abusyu mbuli muntu, nkabela munyama wane wakali mbuli musika uuluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
