        {
          "text": "Lino aba banyama bone bakalijisi umwi aumwi mababa aali musanu mulimwi, nkabela mababa aabo akalizyungulukidwe meso amunkwa, alimwi teebakali kulyokezya abuniini, isikati amasiku, kwaamba kuti, Ulasalala, ulasalala, ulasalala Jehova Leza Singuzuzyoonse, iwakaliko, Uuliko, Uuyoobako.",
